; Ammunition crate. Origin at the ground under it, so a spawner only has to
; know where the ground is.
;
; Solid, and about waist high on the soldier model: it is cover as well as
; supply, which is deliberate. The lid is hinged at the back edge and the scene
; leaves it standing open with brass showing inside -- the script shuts it when
; the box is emptied, so whether a crate is worth walking to is a thing you can
; see from across the street rather than something you find out by arriving.
